ANALOGICA – STUDENT MANAGEMENT SYSTEM
Project Documentation

PROJECT OVERVIEW

Analogica is a web-based Student Management System developed to help educational institutes efficiently manage student operations including enquiries, enrollments, EMI payments, overdue tracking, and financial reporting.

The system is built using:

Flask (Backend API)

MySQL (Database)

HTML, CSS, JavaScript (Frontend)

It provides automation for EMI plan generation and overdue detection.

SYSTEM ARCHITECTURE

Frontend (HTML + CSS + JavaScript)
↓
Flask Backend API
↓
SQLAlchemy ORM
↓
MySQL Database

TECHNOLOGIES USED

Backend:

Python 3.10+

Flask

Flask-Session

Flask-CORS

SQLAlchemy

PyMySQL

ReportLab (PDF Generation)

Frontend:

HTML5

CSS3

Tailwind CSS

JavaScript (Fetch API)

Database:

MySQL

SYSTEM REQUIREMENTS

Make sure your system has:

Python 3.10 or higher

MySQL Server installed

pip (Python package manager)

Git (optional)

DATABASE SETUP (MySQL)

Step 1: Open MySQL and create database

CREATE DATABASE certisured_db;
USE certisured_db;

Step 2: If using SQLAlchemy, tables will auto-create when running app.

Step 3: Add EMI months column (Important update)

ALTER TABLE enrollment ADD COLUMN emi_months INT DEFAULT 0;

Step 4: Verify tables

USE certisured_db;

SELECT * FROM emi;
SELECT * FROM enquiry WHERE status = 'Enquiry';
SELECT id, name, payment_type, amount FROM enrollment;

To check overdue students:

SELECT e.enrollment_id, e.emi_no, e.status
FROM emi e
JOIN enrollment en ON e.enrollment_id = en.id
WHERE e.status = 'Overdue';

PROJECT INSTALLATION GUIDE

Step 1: Clone Project

git clone https://github.com/yourusername/analogica-student-management.git

cd analogica-student-management/backend

Step 2: Create Virtual Environment

python -m venv venv
venv\Scripts\activate (Windows)

Step 3: Install Required Packages

pip install flask flask-session flask-cors flask-sqlalchemy pymysql reportlab

Step 4: Configure Database Connection in app.py

app.config["SQLALCHEMY_DATABASE_URI"] =
"mysql+pymysql://root:yourpassword@localhost/certisured_db"

Replace:

root → your MySQL username

yourpassword → your MySQL password

Step 5: Run Application

python app.py

Open browser and go to:

http://127.0.0.1:5000

AUTHENTICATION SYSTEM

Admin login system

Session-based authentication

Protected API routes

Logout functionality

ENQUIRY MODULE

Features:

Add enquiry manually

Upload CSV file

Import Google Sheet data

Duplicate phone validation

Status tracking (Enquiry / Converted)

ENROLLMENT MODULE

Convert enquiry to enrollment

Choose payment type:

Full Payment

EMI

Store student details

Track enrollment status

EMI MANAGEMENT SYSTEM

Features:

Generate EMI plan

Automatic monthly due date generation

Mark EMI as Paid

Undo payment

Track paid date

Store number of EMI months

Integrated dashboard tracking

EMI Logic:

EMI amount = total amount / months

Due dates generated monthly using date increment logic

OVERDUE SYSTEM

Automatic overdue detection:

If due_date < today AND status != "Paid"
→ Mark EMI as "Overdue"

Fine Calculation:
Fine = ₹50 × number_of_days_overdue

Features:

Overdue list page

Overdue summary

Overdue PDF report

DASHBOARD MODULE

Displays:

Total enrollments

Active students

EMI students

Overdue students

Recent enrollments

Financial summary

REPORT GENERATION

Reports generated using ReportLab:

Student Payment Report (PDF)

EMI Report

Overdue Report

Dashboard Summary

API ENDPOINTS

Authentication:
POST /api/login
POST /api/logout
GET /api/protected

Enrollment:
GET /api/enrollments
GET /api/student/<id>

EMI:
POST /api/emi/generate
GET /api/emi
POST /api/emi/pay
POST /api/emi/undo

